e kind of energy behind the way we played. I barely recognised us, and it helped me find a way forward. We decided to get these live recordings mixed and released (it would have been insane to keep them for ourselves). It has all been a very cathartic process. We very much hope you enjoy them.”","image":"https://f4.bcbits.com/img/a1157680318_10.jpg","site":"Radiohead","point":null,"start":null,"end":null,"group":null},{"id":"18d141aa70d7c27ae4e5b6c822617b7d","uri":"https://www.deezer.com/track/4329888262","status":"ok","type":"MusicRecording","name":"Bohemian Rhapsody","description":"Queen - kappale - 2010","image":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/cover/029f17043a8a2eee106ae659258c985e/500x500.jpg","site":"Deezer","point":null,"start":null,"end":null,"group":null}],"cursor":"TvFuCCHocHT-7_Ax-5r8XI08yJjzZM5sdpikY7IijJp7InZlcnNpb24iOjIsInNjb3JlIjowLjY5MjcyNTY5NTU0NDg4OCwiaWQiOiIxOGQxNDFhYTcwZDdjMjdhZTRlNWI2YzgyMjYxN2I3ZCIsImF0IjoiMjAyNi0xMC0xOVQxOTozODowMS4yMDg2NzAwMzhaIiwiZmlsdGVyIjoiZTEzZmYyMTZjMWQ1YTQ1M2M4MGU2YWU5Njk3MjhjYmRiNGM1YjBkMDEzYTc0ODBkZGYyYzlmNzFkNGUxOTdhZSJ9","reach_truncated":false,"facets":{"tags":[{"label":"music","count":69},{"label":"track","count":28},{"label":"artist","count":21},{"label":"dracula","count":12},{"label":"album","count":11},{"label":"daft-punk","count":11},{"label":"mr-brightside","count":10},{"label":"radiohead","count":10},{"label":"deezer","count":9},{"label":"spotify","count":9},{"label":"tidal","count":8},{"label":"apple-music","count":7},{"label":"cut-to-the-feeling","count":6},{"label":"never-gonna-give-you","count":6},{"label":"beatport","count":5},{"label":"youtube-music","count":5},{"label":"amazon-music","count":4},{"label":"bohemian-rhapsody","count":4},{"label":"music-video","count":4},{"label":"qobuz","count":4},{"label":"youtube","count":4},{"label":"banger","count":2},{"label":"bitcoin","count":2},{"label":"electronic-music","count":2},{"label":"hip-hop","count":2},{"label":"soundcloud","count":2},{"label":"1420-